    combined_output {
      full: "<truncated 23 bytes>\nem  full: 9999pxspacing:  gutter: 1.5rem  margin: 2rem  space-xs: 0.25rem  space-sm: 0.5rem  space-md: 1rem  space-lg: 1.5rem  space-xl: 2.5rem---## Brand & StyleThis design system is tailored for an elite architectural engineering brand specializing in automated entryways, glass railings, smart facades, and electric roll-up systems. The brand communicates precision engineering, transparency, modern luxury, and safety. ### Target Audience & Emotional Intent- **Audience:** Architects, commercial developers, interior project managers, and upscale residential homeowners seeking premium architectural hardware and entrance solutions.- **Emotional Response:** Confidence in German-grade reliability, sleek technological advancement, architectural fluidity, and effortless minimalism.### Design Style: Modern Architectural GlassmorphismThe aesthetic synthesizes crisp, light-flooded architectural photography with luminous emerald-tinted accents. Subtle glassmorphic layers echo the actual glass handrails and automatic sliding doors manufactured by the company. Fluid rounded geometry, generous whitespace, pristine charcoal typography, and glowing mint green call-to-actions deliver an approachable, futuristic, and distinctly executive RTL digital experience.## ColorsThe color system pairs architectural purity with high-tech vitality:- **Primary (`#10B981`) & Neon Mint (`#00E676`):** Represent energy, dynamic automation, and precision. Applied to high-impact conversion buttons, status tags, hover highlights, and radiant drop glows.- **Secondary / Deep Slate (`#0F172A`):** The primary color for bold typography, high-contrast structural dark modules, and header status bars, offering grounded architectural stability.- **Surface Background (`#FAFCFB`) & Pure White (`#FFFFFF`):** Create an airy, daylight-infused showroom atmosphere reminiscent of pristine structural glass and polished aluminum.- **Glass & Translucency:** Used across floating navigation headers, sticky quotation bars, and technical specification cards to evoke the product line\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275s structural glass materials.## TypographyThe design system incorporates a modern, geometric sans-serif aesthetic specifically tailored for Persian right-to-left layout dynamics. In production, fonts map to contemporary Persian geometric typefaces such as **Vazirmatn** or **Dana**, with `Plus Jakarta Sans` functioning as the universal geometric companion for Western numerals and Latin code models.### Typographic Rules:- **Persian Glyphs and Numerals:** Numerical values within technical dimensions (e.g., mm, kg, motor torque ratings) must support Persian localized numbering alongside Latin technical units.- **Line Heights:** Given the taller ascenders and descenders of Persian script, line heights are increased by 10\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\27515% compared to standard Latin baselines to prevent glyph clipping.- **Display Weights:** Main hero titles use high-weight headline styling with emerald gradient text spans to emphasize key technological[...resync +8b...]t[...resync +8b...]r[...resync +8b...]s (e.g., \357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275 \357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275, \357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275[...resync +58b...]\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275).## Layout & SpacingLayouts adhere to an RTL 12-column responsive fluid grid designed for architectural presentation.### Breakpoints & Grids- **Desktop (1200px+):** 12-column grid, max content container width of 1280px, 32px gutters, and 48px outer canvas margin.- **Tablet (768px \357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275 1199px):** 8-column grid, 24px gutters, and 32px canvas margin.- **Mobile (< 768px):** 4-column grid, 16px gutters, and 20px canvas margin.### Alignment & Directionality- All primary visual[...resync +58b...]\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275including navigation menus, titles, brand monograms, and icon prefixes\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275originate from the right margin.- Phone callouts, social handles, and linear spec progressions flow naturally from right to left, while Western technical units and measurements preserve standard LTR digit alignment inside bidirectional text blocks.## Elevation & DepthVisual hierarchy uses frosted glass refraction, crisp border definition, and ambient mint-toned drop shadows:- **Level 1 (Structural Cards / Panels):** Solid white `#FFFFFF` surface backed by a delicate outline `rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.8)` and a soft ambient shadow `0 4px 20px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04)`.- **Level 2 (Interactive Cards & Catalog Tiles):** Elevates on cursor hover with `0 12px 32px -4px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08)`, shifting up 4px along the Y-axis with a subtle emerald border highlight `rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4)`.- **Level 3 (Glassmorphic Navigation & Floating Bars):** Translucent background `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78)` paired with `backdrop-filter: blur(16px)`, a crisp white boundary edge `1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9)`, and shadow `0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05)`.- **Glowing Elements (CTA & Badges):** Primary action buttons project a soft neon mint aura using `box-shadow: 0 8px 24px -2px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35)`.## ShapesThe design system embraces pill-shaped, ultra-smooth architectural curvature (roundedness tier 3). This reflects modern extruded aluminum profiles, curved glass canopies, and ergonomic tubular door handles.- **Buttons & Chips:** Completely pill-shaped (`9999px` border radius) providing an inviting, tactile touch surface.- **Product Display Cards:** Generously curved with 24px to 32px corners, creating an elegant frame for architectural glass photography.- **Badges & Micro-tags:** Compact pill curves (12px\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\27516px) hugging the typography snugly.## Components### Buttons- **Pr[...resync +8b...]m[...resync +8b...]ry A[...resync +8b...]tion (\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275 \357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275[...resync +64b...]\357\277\275[...resync +56b...]\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275 \357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275):** Pill-shaped button with a linear gradient spanning from `#10B981` to `#00E676`. Pure white bold text, subtle neon green glow on hover, and smooth 2px upward translation.- **Seco[...resync +8b...]d[...resync +8b...]r[...resync +8b...] Action (\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275 \357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275 / \357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275 \357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275[...resync +58b...]\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275):** Frosted white or slate container with an emerald or crisp slate border, dark charcoal text, and smooth fill transitions.- **Icon Placement:** Icons sit logically on the trailing edge (left side for RTL forwar[...resync +8b...] [...resync +8b...]l[...resync +8b...]ws like \"\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275[...resync +64b...]\357\277\275[...resync +56b...] \357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\").### Product & Architectural Cards- Features an ultra-clean card frame with a 16:10 ratio visual container displaying automatic sliding doors, telescopic tracks, or glass handrails.- A floating frosted glass pill badge in the upper right corner displays category classific[...resync +8b...]t[...resync +8b...]o[...resync +8b...]s (e.g., \357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275 \357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275 \357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275 o[...resync +64b...]\357\277\275[...resync +56b...] \357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275 \357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275).- Title, brief spec breakdown, and an inline price estimator or quote trigger live below the visual preview.### Chips & Filter Tags- Used in product catalog fil[...resync +8b...]e[...resync +8b...]i[...resync +8b...]g (e.g., \357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275 \357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275, \357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275 \357\277\275\357\277\275a6\357\277\2758\357\277\275#6\357\277\275v,v*6a\357\277\275)\357\277\275*\357\277\275\b6a\357\277\275a\357\277\275+\357\277\275,[...resync +60b...]j\357\277\275b\357\277\275f\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275\357\277\275).- Resting state: Soft slate tint background `#F1F5F9`, muted slate text.- Active state: Saturated emerald background with bright white text and an ambient mint blur.### Input Fields & Quotation Forms- Clean white background with a 12px pill/soft radius, bordered in `rgba(203, 213, 225, 0.7)`.- Focus state highlights with a 2px emerald outline and a gentle mint focus ring (`rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15)`).- Input labels and hint placeholders align strictly to the right edge with adequate RTL margin offset.### Technical Specification List- Alternating subtle neutral zebra-rows or discrete bottom hairline rules (`#F1F5F9`).- Left-aligned numeric technical values (weight, power, glass thickness) balanced with right-aligned feature descriptions"
