  planner_response {
    response: "I have built the **Elessa Architectural Systems (\330\247\331\204\330\263\330\247)** static frontend web application in React and Tailwind CSS, matching your Persian RTL design specification without any backend or API dependencies.\n\n### What Was Built\n- **Design System & RTL Typography**: Configured native Persian RTL layout (`dir=\"rtl\"`) pairing **Vazirmatn** with **Plus Jakarta Sans** and **JetBrains Mono** (`tabular-nums`) for Latin model codes and technical units, alongside the exact daylight glassmorphic color palette (`#FAFCFB`, `#FFFFFF`, `#0F172A`, `#006C49`, `#10B981`, `#00E676`), three-level elevation shadows, pill buttons, and `28px`\342\200\223`32px` architectural card geometry.\n- **Home Showroom (`\330\265\331\201\330\255\331\207 \330\247\330\265\331\204\333\214`)**: 12-column RTL hero with emerald gradient display accents and architectural glass entrance photography, a 4-column engineering metrics strip, an asymmetric four-division product showcase, a featured architectural case study with architect testimonial, a 4-step workflow, and a deep-slate conversion banner.\n- **Interactive Product Catalog & Technical Spec Viewer (`\331\205\330\255\330\265\331\210\331\204\330\247\330\252`)**: Filterable by category pill chips (`\330\257\330\261\330\250 \330\247\330\252\331\210\331\205\330\247\330\252\333\214\332\251`, `\331\207\331\206\330\257\330\261\333\214\331\204 \330\247\332\251\330\263\331\276\331\210\330\262 \331\210 \331\206\330\261\330\257\331\207 \330\264\333\214\330\264\331\207\342\200\214\330\247\333\214`, `\331\206\331\205\330\247\333\214 \331\207\331\210\330\264\331\205\331\206\330\257 \331\210 \330\263\330\247\333\214\330\250\330\247\331\206`, `\332\251\330\261\332\251\330\261\331\207 \331\276\331\204\333\214\342\200\214\332\251\330\261\330\250\331\206\330\247\330\252`), building application, and live search. Opening any product reveals its finish swatches, quick dimension estimator, and a zebra-row RTL/LTR technical specification table.\n- **Completed Projects Portfolio (`\331\276\330\261\331\210\332\230\331\207\342\200\214\331\207\330\247`)**: Filterable showcase of commercial, corporate, retail, and residential installations with detailed engineering case study modals.\n- **Client-Side Price Estimator & Quotation Generator (`\330\250\330\261\330\242\331\210\330\261\330\257 \331\202\333\214\331\205\330\252`)**: Interactive engineering configurator calculating glass weight (`kg`), recommended leaf/post configuration, and itemized cost estimates, paired with a glassmorphic sticky quote bar, a validated RTL quotation form, and a printable preliminary proforma receipt."
    thinking: "**Reviewing Clean Compilation**\n\nI\'m thrilled! Both `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` passed perfectly on the first attempt. No warnings, no errors! I\'m now conducting a silent review of the code against the Elessa Architectural Systems design specification and the frontend design checklist to ensure full compliance.\n\n\n"
